{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（2日）早上10時50分，尖沙咀彌敦道82號滙豐大廈內，有2名男子出示面值約3000萬美金（即約2.3億港元）的支票要求提款，銀行職員經驗證後，證實為假支票，遂報警求助。</p><p>警方到場調查，案件列作「行使虛假文書」。</p><figure><img alt=\"警員在銀行內調查。（彭紹殷攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260702/1149311803621511168315874.jpeg/EK1J72XYSh2bC4sgAKV1NSWfVu1_489g4OoLU8rqC1M\"/><figcaption>警員在銀行內調查。（彭紹殷攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方到場調查，案件列作「行使虛假文書」。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260702/1149311801113186304635184.jpeg/g93Zh7bApz3EsNjCYn2tCYMX0CT4tTOzFWqeVj9qnlY\"/><figcaption>警方到場調查，案件列作「行使虛假文書」。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場為尖沙咀彌敦道82號滙豐大廈。（翁鈺輝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260702/1149312208832827392704892.jpeg/iONSNtjxk3cYGCbVtC5Zy8cqSXcip46T62nR1cFp0dU\"/><figcaption>現場為尖沙咀彌敦道82號滙豐大廈。（翁鈺輝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場為尖沙咀彌敦道82號滙豐大廈（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260702/1149311795362533376132089.jpeg/y9k0iAsKZzpJyzEs2rjtPyt_-9posXyCMI3_8hqN__I\"/><figcaption>現場為尖沙咀彌敦道82號滙豐大廈（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-02T03:45:58.864503+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":197,"images":4,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}